is]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n(2^{&lt;\\omega})\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n(2^{&lt;\\omega})\\)</span> 指 code 像属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n\\)</span> 的串集合。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a797b7e3c0ca674d\" href=\"?note=a797b7e3c0ca674d\" title=\"20-df-dense-strings\">20-df-dense-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ngen}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{nGeneric}(G,n)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\Sigma^0_n(2^{&lt;\\omega})\\\n[(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in S)\\lor\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ \\tau\\notin S)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,n)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\in\\Sigma^0_n(2^{&lt;\\omega})\\\n[\\operatorname{DenseStrings}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in S].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ngen}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{nGeneric}(G,n)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\Sigma^0_n(2^{&lt;\\omega})\\\n[(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in S)\\lor\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ \\tau\\notin S)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,n)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\in\\Sigma^0_n(2^{&lt;\\omega})\\\n[\\operatorname{DenseStrings}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in S].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 写成串集合并只列稠密条件，混淆了对象类型及强弱 generic。此处是 §6.3 的自然层级扩展，n&gt;1 并非该节单独陈述的定义，明确标为本地扩展。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.3.1 的层级扩展；印刷页 137；PDF 第 171 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dense-strings","status":"resolved","id":"a797b7e3c0ca674d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-dense-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-dense-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-dense-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dense-strings","status":"resolved","id":"a797b7e3c0ca674d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-dense-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n(2^{<\\omega})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n","display":false},{"tex":